    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94599" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκᾰρῑφ-ησμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a scratching up</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαριφησμοὶ λήρων</span>
			<i>petty quibbles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1497
			</span></i>, ubi v. Sch.(<i><span class="en">
				1545
			</span></i>), prob. cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				14.5
			</span></i> (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαρφηθμοῖς</span> codd.);
			also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαριφήματα</span></b> , Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				630
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαλαθύρματα</span>
			; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκᾰρῑφ-εύματα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαλαθυρμάτια</span>
			; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκᾰρῑφ-ίσματα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαλαθυρμάτια</span>
			.</div>
